{"source": "align_vo.py (wav2vec2-base-960h CTC)", "lines": [{"text": "Abrir los datos financieros parece la meta.", "start": 3.26, "end": 5.58, "words": [{"w": "Abrir", "start": 3.26, "end": 3.62}, {"w": "los", "start": 3.62, "end": 3.82}, {"w": "datos", "start": 3.82, "end": 4.12}, {"w": "financieros", "start": 4.12, "end": 4.86}, {"w": "parece", "start": 4.86, "end": 5.32}, {"w": "la", "start": 5.32, "end": 5.44}, {"w": "meta.", "start": 5.44, "end": 5.58}]}, {"text": "Pero abrir no basta.", "start": 6.08, "end": 7.38, "words": [{"w": "Pero", "start": 6.08, "end": 6.28}, {"w": "abrir", "start": 6.28, "end": 6.72}, {"w": "no", "start": 6.94, "end": 7.12}, {"w": "basta.", "start": 7.12, "end": 7.38}]}, {"text": "Aprendizaje 2: regulación que abre, no fragmenta.", "start": 7.96, "end": 11.6, "words": [{"w": "Aprendizaje", "start": 7.96, "end": 8.82}, {"w": "2:", "start": 8.82, "end": 9.02}, {"w": "regulación", "start": 9.46, "end": 10.2}, {"w": "que", "start": 10.2, "end": 10.4}, {"w": "abre,", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.76}, {"w": "no", "start": 11.0, "end": 11.16}, {"w": "fragmenta.", "start": 11.16, "end": 11.6}]}, {"text": "La regulación dejó de ser solo cumplimiento: ahora es arquitectura de mercado.", "start": 12.18, "end": 16.89, "words": [{"w": "La", "start": 12.18, "end": 12.34}, {"w": "regulación", "start": 12.34, "end": 12.94}, {"w": "dejó", "start": 12.94, "end": 13.18}, {"w": "de", "start": 13.18, "end": 13.32}, {"w": "ser", "start": 13.32, "end": 13.58}, {"w": "solo", "start": 13.58, "end": 13.88}, {"w": "cumplimiento:", "start": 13.88, "end": 14.43}, {"w": "ahora", "start": 14.86, "end": 15.37}, {"w": "es", "start": 15.37, "end": 15.54}, {"w": "arquitectura", "start": 15.54, "end": 16.34}, {"w": "de", "start": 16.34, "end": 16.42}, {"w": "mercado.", "start": 16.42, "end": 16.89}]}, {"text": "Lo vimos en tres insights.", "start": 17.14, "end": 18.56, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "start": 17.14, "end": 17.3}, {"w": "vimos", "start": 17.3, "end": 17.7}, {"w": "en